只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Delete DSH conversations instead of archiving them, see the whole family a conversation spawned (its subagents and derived conversations), and delete in bulk. / 真正删除 DeepSeek Harness 里的会话，并看清它生出的子智能体与派生对话。","id":"gh:1396543508","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"better-dsh-session-deletetool","slug":"Lzcdebear/better-dsh-session-deletetool","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-desktop","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Delete DSH conversations instead of archiving them, see the whole family a conversation spawned (its"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" subagents and derived conversations), and delete in bulk. / 真正删除 DeepSeek Harness 里的会话，并看清它生出的子智能体与"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"gents and derived conversations), and delete in bulk. / 真正删除 DeepSeek Harness 里的会话，并看清它生出的子智能体与派生对话。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# better-dsh-session-deletetool"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Delete a DeepSeek Harness conversation for real, and manage the whole family around it.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"DSH ships archive only. This plugin adds a real delete — session log, Workspace account, archive/pin"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"\nmembership and projection-cache record — and surrounds it with the numbers and folders you need to\n"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"decide what to remove."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"中文说明"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## What it adds"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **Real delete.** The log directory goes, the Workspace record forgets the session, archive and pin"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"\nmembership are cleared, and the projection-cache record is dropped. DSH's own archive only hides.\n-"},{"id":"p7s3","text":" **The conversation family, as a tree.** A main conversation, its forked conversations and its\nsubag"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"ents, nested by `parentSession` — a subagent that spawned its own subagent sits one level\ndeeper. In"},{"id":"p7s5","text":" the single dialog a parent click selects only that node (blank until it is selected,\nthen green, ye"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"llow or red for itself / some descendants / the whole family), and the top\nSelect all box takes the "},{"id":"p7s7","text":"whole family.\n- **Usage per conversation.** A node counts only the requests it made itself. A parent"},{"id":"p7s8","text":" also shows\n`own/family`, the family total after a slash.\n- **Three-way token bar.** Cache-hit input"},{"id":"p7s9","text":" (green), cache-miss input (blue), output (yellow), with the\nthree percentages underneath. Cache hit"},{"id":"p7s10","text":" rate = hit / (hit + miss + write).\n- **Fork-aware counting.** A forked conversation's inherited log"},{"id":"p7s11","text":" prefix is skipped, and requests are\nde-duplicated by message id, so a fork never re-counts its pare"},{"id":"p7s12","text":"nt's past.\n- **Local folders.** A folder button on every row opens that node's directory. The Host r"},{"id":"p7s13","text":"esolves the\npath through `sessionPersistence.locate`; it is never rebuilt from a conversation title."},{"id":"p7s14","text":"\n- **Bulk management.** One card per family with search, sort by last activity / tokens / hit rate,\n"},{"id":"p7s15","text":"filters by kind and Workspace, paging, per-page select, delete selected, and delete all behind a\nsec"},{"id":"p7s16","text":"ond confirmation.\n- **Cache controls.** Open DSH's projection-cache folder, and read what that folde"},{"id":"p7s17","text":"r is under the action bar.\n- **Usage switch.** Turn usage off and the Host stops reading session log"},{"id":"p7s18","text":"s entirely; token and cache figures read “Off”."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"All routes go through DSH's plugin manager:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- GitHub: `plugin_manager { action: \"install_bundle\", target: \"github:Lzcdebear/better-dsh-session-d"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"eletetool\" }`\n- Local copy: `plugin_manager { action: \"install_bundle\", target: \"<absolute path to t"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"he unpacked folder>\" }`\n- Tarball: `https://github.com/Lzcdebear/better-dsh-session-deletetool/archi"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"ve/refs/heads/main.tar.gz`"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Refresh the page after installing. Changes to the Host half need a full restart of DSH."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"To remove: `plugin_manager { action: \"remove_bundle\", target: \"better-dsh-session-deletetool\" }`."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"**One conversation.** Open a session's `⋯` menu and pick **Delete conversation**. The dialog shows t"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"he\nfamily tree, that conversation's own usage and family total, the cache split, and a folder button"},{"id":"p15s3","text":", that conversation's own usage and family total, the cache split, and a folder button on\nevery row."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"**Bulk.** Press the trash control in the Workspace header, left of the search icon. Each family is a"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"\ncard; tick rows, filter, sort, page, then delete the selection or every conversation."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Before deleting, the Host asks DSH's own activity admission. Running work is reported; it is stopped"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"\nonly after you confirm."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## HTTP surface"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Same-origin routes on `ctx.webServer`:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Route | Method | Purpose |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| `/better-dsh-session-deletetool/inspect?sessionId=…` | GET | state, family rows, usage and folder "},{"id":"p21s2","text":"per node |\n| `/better-dsh-session-deletetool/delete` | POST | `{ sessionId, stop?, descendants? }` |"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"\n| `/better-dsh-session-deletetool/catalog` | GET | every session with usage and folder, plus a corp"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"us summary |\n| `/better-dsh-session-deletetool/delete-batch` | POST | `{ roots: [{ sessionId, descen"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"dants? }], stop?, cleanCache? }` |\n| `/better-dsh-session-deletetool/open-directory` | POST | `{ ses"},{"id":"p21s6","text":"sionId }` — open that session's folder |\n| `/better-dsh-session-deletetool/open-cache` | POST | open"},{"id":"p21s7","text":" DSH's projection-cache folder |\n| `/better-dsh-session-deletetool/refresh-stats` | POST | drop the "},{"id":"p21s8","text":"plugin's cached usage folds |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Every route carries a loopback and same-origin gate, so another page cannot reach them."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Layout"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| File | Role |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| `host.js` | Host half: the routes, removal, family walk, catalog and corpus totals |\n| `session-mo"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"del.js` | Usage folding, directory resolution, cache invalidation |\n| `client.js` | Client half: the"},{"id":"p25s3","text":" menu row, the bulk control, and the two dialogs |\n| `cordis.patch.yml` | Inserts the Host row into "},{"id":"p25s4","text":"the profile's layer stack |\n| `test/host.test.mjs` | Route tests over real temporary directories |\n|"},{"id":"p25s5","text":" `icon.svg` | Plugin artwork |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Styles use host theme tokens (`--dsw-alias-*`) only, so light and dark both read; the UI is localize"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"d\n(English / 简体中文) through the Client locale service."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Known limits"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- Fork lineage is read from `inheritedEventCount`. This build has no fork sample, so that path follo"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"ws\nthe field's meaning but has not been exercised against real data.\n- A session whose folder the ba"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"ckend cannot locate keeps its folder button disabled, with the reason\nin its tooltip.\n- Usage is fol"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"ded from each log on first read; later reads reuse a size + mtime cache. About ninety\nsessions fold "},{"id":"p28s5","text":"in under a second on this machine."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Thanks"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Issues and reports that shaped this version:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"- @rowan-firm\n- @Wolf-Keys"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"MIT"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## Author"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"- Bilibili: <https://space.bilibili.com/220996778>"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
